{{Uses TemplateStyles|Template:Red link/styles.css}}

This template is used to create a red link, but prevent it from showing up on the list of [[Special:WantedPages|{{int|wantedpages}}]].

== Usage ==
 <nowiki>{{</nowiki>red link|''page name''|''displayed name (defaults to page name)''<nowiki>}}</nowiki>

⇒ {{red link|page name|displayed name|nocat=1}}

